{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫飲食資訊綜藝《美食強人》今晚（29日）起一連兩晚以西多士為主題，邀得陳山聰及黎芷珊擔任星級食評家。</p><p>4間食店雖各具特色，評審評分卻相當嚴謹，令主持之一的陳豪始料不及。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:17.569327+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:37:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.757231+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:17.569327+00:00","content_hash":"b3bd11a643d192fe77fb83671f3754a559c7c9733a885c6a5e6a0258e72c9b49","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}